        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies/Organizations: Puddle of Mudd\n- Topics: rock bands, album sales, discography\n\nFacts:\n- Puddle of Mudd is an American rock band that formed in 1991.\n- Members of Puddle of Mudd came from other local bands such as The Yah Mos, Black Liquorice, and Popesmashers.\n- Puddle of Mudd has sold over seven million albums and has had multiple No. 1 mainstream rock singles in the United States.\n- Puddle of Mudd's major-label debut album, \"Come Clean,\" has sold over five million copies.\n- Puddle of Mudd has released two independent albums and four major-label albums.\n- Puddle of Mudd's latest album as of December 2009 and its most recent compilation album as of August 2011 are mentioned, but their titles are missing in the chunk.",
